<view class="page">
  <view class="text-h2">身份认证</view>
  <view class="text-sub" style="margin-top: 8rpx;">
    身份证仅用于平台审核，不公开展示。请确保与「真实姓名」一致。
  </view>

  <view class="card section">
    <view class="row">
      <view class="row-label">真实姓名</view>
      <input class="row-input" placeholder="与身份证一致" placeholder-class="ph" value="{{ realName }}" bindinput="onRealNameInput" maxlength="32" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="text-sub section-title">身份证图片</view>
  <view class="id-row">
    <view class="id-card" bindtap="pickIdCard" data-side="front">
      <image
        wx:if="{{ idCardFrontUrl }}"
        class="id-img"
        src="{{ idCardFrontUrl }}"
        mode="aspectFill"
        catchtap="previewIdCard"
        data-side="front"
      />
      <view wx:else class="id-placeholder">
        <text class="plus" wx:if="{{ !uploadingFront }}">+</text>
        <text wx:else>上传中…</text>
        <text class="id-tip" wx:if="{{ !uploadingFront }}">人像面</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="id-card" bindtap="pickIdCard" data-side="back">
      <image
        wx:if="{{ idCardBackUrl }}"
        class="id-img"
        src="{{ idCardBackUrl }}"
        mode="aspectFill"
        catchtap="previewIdCard"
        data-side="back"
      />
      <view wx:else class="id-placeholder">
        <text class="plus" wx:if="{{ !uploadingBack }}">+</text>
        <text wx:else>上传中…</text>
        <text class="id-tip" wx:if="{{ !uploadingBack }}">国徽面</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="text-muted text-xs id-note">
    * 请保证身份证清晰可辨，四角完整，无反光。
  </view>

  <view class="text-sub section-title">地址定位</view>
  <view class="card location-card" bindtap="chooseLocation">
    <view class="location-info">
      <view class="text-body" wx:if="{{ addressDetail }}">{{ addressDetail }}</view>
      <view class="text-muted" wx:else>点击选择地图位置</view>
      <view class="text-xs text-muted" wx:if="{{ latitude !== null && longitude !== null }}">
        经纬度：{{ latitude }}, {{ longitude }}
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="text-muted">›</view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer-spacer"></view>
  <view class="footer-bar">
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onSave" disabled="{{ saving }}">
      {{ saving ? '保存中...' : '保存' }}
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
